    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5803-0822"
title: "Forest Diameter Distribution Modelling"
abstract: >-
  An R pipeline that fits twelve candidate probability distributions to tree
  diameter at breast height (DBH) data by maximum likelihood, ranks them with
  Kolmogorov–Smirnov, Anderson–Darling and Cramér–von Mises statistics, and
  produces diagnostic plots and parameter tables.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-01-01"    # adjust
url: "https://github.com/abiodun-oyediran/01-forest-diameter-distribution-modelling"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - forest biometrics
  - diameter distribution
  - probability distributions
  - maximum likelihood
  - R
